    "details": "<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Title:</strong> Tech Zephyr 4.0 CP Contest &mdash; IIT Bhubaneswar</p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Participation Type:</strong> Individual (1 Member)</p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">Eligibility:</strong> Open to all college students.</p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">About the Competition:</strong> Welcome to the Tech Zephyr CP Contest! Get ready to test your algorithmic thinking, problem-solving speed, and coding proficiency. This competitive programming contest is designed to push your limits with a series of challenging problems ranging from basic data structures to advanced algorithms.</p>\n<p>Whether you are a seasoned competitive programmer or a beginner looking to test your skills, this is your chance to shine on the leaderboard!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/BEaYwxo0wRVHjHppukMtbe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp Group</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Competition Format:</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Participation:</strong> Individual only (no team participation).</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Duration:</strong> 135 minutes (2 hours 15 minutes).</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Problem Set:</strong> 4 to 6 coding problems of varying difficulty levels (Easy to Hard).</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Languages Supported:</strong> C, C++, Java, Python, and other standard languages supported by the GFG practice portal.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mode:</strong> Completely Online.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rules and Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Individual Effort:</strong> This is a solo competition. Discussing problems or sharing code with others during the contest is strictly prohibited.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Plagiarism:</strong> All submissions will be run through a strict plagiarism checker on the GFG platform. Any participant found using AI tools, copying from the internet, or sharing code will be immediately disqualified.</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Evaluation:</strong> Problems will be evaluated automatically against hidden test cases. Standard competitive programming scoring applies (based on the time of submission and the number of incorrect attempts).</li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decisions:</strong> The decisions made by the organizing committee regarding test cases, scoring, and disqualifications will be final and binding.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Prizes Worth: ₹15,000 INR</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>Instagram link : https://www.instagram.com/techzephyr.iitbbs/</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ready to Code?</strong></p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">135 minutes. Algorithmic challenges. Pure coding brilliance.</strong></p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Think it. Code it. Prove your skills.</strong></p>\n<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tech Zephyr &mdash; IIT Bhubaneswar</strong></p>",
